 # 11\. AI Architecture

 A useful design is to **separate financial calculations from the language model**.

```
             User Question
                   │
                   ▼
          ┌─────────────────┐
          │ Intent Detection│
          └────────┬────────┘
                   │
          ┌────────┴────────┐
          ▼                 ▼
   Financial Query     General Query
          │
          ▼
   Financial Engine
          │
          ▼
   Verified Calculations
          │
          ▼
      AI Response
          │
          ▼
    User Explanation
```

 This prevents the AI model from being responsible for basic arithmetic.

 For example, calculations such as income minus expenses should be performed by deterministic application code, while the AI can explain the result in natural language.

