 # 20\. Security Design

 Financial information is sensitive, so security should be considered from the design stage.

 ### Authentication

 - Secure password hashing
- Session/token-based authentication
- Logout/session expiration

 ### Authorization

 Every financial-data request should verify that the authenticated user owns the requested data.

 ### Data protection

 - HTTPS
- Encrypted sensitive information where appropriate
- Server-side validation
- Parameterized database queries
- Rate limiting for sensitive APIs
- Avoid storing unnecessary financial information

 ### AI privacy

 Only the minimum necessary financial context should be sent to an external AI service, where applicable.

