Missing income
      ↓
"Add your monthly income before creating a budget."

AI unavailable
      ↓
"AI insights are temporarily unavailable.
Your transaction data is still saved."

Insufficient data
      ↓
"Add more transactions to generate meaningful
spending insights."
```

